; atleastw_k_zero: ATLEASTW with k = 0 raises IndexOutOfBounds.
;
; spec/xqvm/ISA.md's ATLEASTW row: IndexOutOfBounds if k <= 0. The model
; register holds a model and the vec lengths match, so no other fault is
; live.

PUSH 4
BQMX r0
VECI r1
PUSH 0
VECPUSH r1
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r1       ; indices = [0, 1]
VECI r2
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r2
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r2       ; weights = [1, 1]
PUSH 0           ; k = 0
PUSH 1           ; penalty
ATLEASTW r0 r1 r2
HALT
